  "desc": "Load-restraint chain for securing cargo on trucks, trailers, flatbeds and rail. Available as Grade 70 Transport Binder Chain (Type BC70) complete with clevis grab hooks — WLL 3,150–6,600 lb (MBS 12,600–26,400 lb) in 1/4″–3/8″ sizes — and as Grade 80 Tie-Down Chain (Type TDC) in 7.1–13.0 mm, WLL 1.5–5.3 t at a 4:1 design factor with proof load to twice the working load. Heat-treated alloy links resist wear and shock loading. Manufactured and rated to ASTM/NACM (BC70) and EN Grade 80 (TDC). Note: chains fitted with grab hooks must be de-rated by at least 30%.",
